# Loaded by `vite --mode diagnostics` (npm run diagnostics). Dev server only:
# when the receiver completes a transfer it POSTs a JSON run report to
# /__diagnostics, and build/diagnostics-endpoint.ts prints it in this terminal.
# The client call sits behind import.meta.env.DEV, which is statically false in
# every build — no static site, GitHub Pages deploy, or standalone file ever
# contains the reporting code. Kept as a mode file rather than an inline env
# var so the scripts work identically on Windows.
VITE_DIAGNOSTICS=1
